["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Aaron Levie, Steven Sinofsky &amp; Martin Casado: How Do You Secure a World of AI Agents? pacing X-risk FINRA tempest attack covert channel\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-a16z-喊出物种灭绝风险却只肯放慢发布节奏-这套说辞两头不讨好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>喊出物種滅絕風險卻只肯放慢發布節奏，這套說辭兩頭不討好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果真信AI有滅絕級風險，唯一自洽的應對是國有化管控，而不是自願放慢發布節奏——現在這套說法讓監管者和行業都不滿意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"898: An Argument HBCU PWI (Predominantly White Institution)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-tal-她为教育平等把女儿送进薄弱学校-翻旧邮件后却向女儿道了歉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a15149eee287a5ec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>她為教育平等把女兒送進薄弱學校，翻舊郵件後卻向女兒道了歉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十年前她的文章說服無數家長相信融合教育，十年後翻出自己求助學校未果的舊郵件，她才第一次向女兒承認自己錯了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育公平</span><span class=\"tag\">種族融合</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenRouter: from Seed to Stripe — with OpenRouter’s Alex Atallah &amp; AMP’s Anjney Midha BYOK auto router Mixture of Models (MoM) wrapper OpenClaw\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-latentspace-模型训练不难-难的是送到开发者手上-顶级实验室常年做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/debf89b08ca0ef78-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>模型訓練不難，難的是送到開發者手上——頂級實驗室常年做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic花了一年多才讓Claude觸達開發者，OpenRouter卻能在新模型發布當天送去100萬開發者——分發，才是模型實驗室最大的短板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型路由</span><span class=\"tag\">開發者分發</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Investing In The Great Wealth Transfer: Masters in Business with Adam Frank QSBS inter vivos NIL 10b5-1 plan direct indexing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-mastersinbiz-跑赢指数半个点没人在意-省下十万美元的税却让客户记你一辈子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>跑贏指數半個點沒人在意，省下十萬美元的稅卻讓客戶記你一輩子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">客戶對跑贏或跑輸基準零點五個百分點幾乎無感，但如果你能幫他省下十萬美元的稅，他就會認定你是不可替代的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富管理</span><span class=\"tag\">遺產規劃</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Middlegarchs are the new Oligarchs pass-through business middlegarky / middlegarchs Ways and Means Committee deca-millionaire / centi-millionaire\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-planetmoney-美国真正有权力的不是亿万富豪-是三百万个隐形富人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">30:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>美國真正有權力的不是億萬富豪，是三百萬個隱形富人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三百萬名穿透式企業主合計持有的財富是福布斯400強的13倍以上，還佔據國會稅法委員會四分之一的席位，真正決定稅制和市場規則的是他們。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">稅制改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Zero to One in AI Safety: Halcyon&#x27;s Mike McCormick on Launching 30 New Orgs &amp; the Founder Bottleneck AI 2027 Public Benefit Corporation (PBC) Self-Other Overlap GRAM (Gradient-Routed Auxiliary Modules) Independent Verification Organizations (IVO) zero knowledge proofs for inference verification\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-cogrev-ai安全领域最缺的不是资金-而是会建组织的创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b147a0ec6a4652db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:50:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全領域最缺的不是資金，而是會建組織的創始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Halcyon三年孵化出30家機構、帶動約5億美元資金，創始人的組織能力才是把宏大而模糊的安全構想變成真正機構的稀缺資源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">創業孵化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Potemkin Pacific, Midterm Budget Woes work at risk FME (foreign material exploitation) CCA (collaborative combat aircraft) combined minds hellscape\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-chinatalk-太平洋司令的舰队全在中东-不战而胜是因为他没兵可战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e7341616991c2db6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>太平洋司令的艦隊全在中東：不戰而勝是因為他沒兵可戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Paparo 上了時代週刊封面，說法是他的部隊覆蓋半個地球、必須不戰而勝；同一周 40% 的在航海軍壓在中東，印太司令部剛改名叫太平洋司令部，而它的船全在印度洋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國防預算</span><span class=\"tag\">無人系統</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Grass Apes silicate (phytolith) Poaceae Homopoaceae\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-radiolab-小麦水稻和直立行走-可能都是被禾草-驯化-的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23580c7e7c6b632c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">22:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>小麥水稻和直立行走，可能都是被禾草「馴化」的結果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">生物學家David Haskell認為，禾草是人類演化的「共同締造者」——不僅決定了我們吃什麼，還可能是我們站起來用兩條腿走路的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人類演化</span><span class=\"tag\">植物學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Busses and Overpasses parkway Muzak\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-stuffmissed-摩西压低立交桥挡黑人的证据-只来自一个死无对证的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>摩西壓低立交橋擋黑人的證據，只來自一個死無對證的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這個說法出自摩西助手 Sidney Shapiro 對 Caro 的講述，但 Shapiro 在書出版前兩年就去世了，而且部分被指控的橋梁其實是照搬 Westchester 已有橋梁尺寸建的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市規劃</span><span class=\"tag\">種族主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Raising Capable Friends, Not Just Capable Kids, Sissy Goff and David Thomas on Navigating Friendship Season FAIL (First Attempt In Learning) back pocket questions balcony friends / basement friends charismatic characters pace setters\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-raisinggh-别教孩子怎么交朋友-教他们怎么当一个好朋友/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98a9c15570a9f337-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">47:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>別教孩子怎麼交朋友，教他們怎麼當一個好朋友</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理諮詢師發現，孩子社交焦慮的解藥不是教他們討好誰，而是引導他們把注意力從「我」轉向對方，主動去當一個好朋友。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">社交焦慮</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Hollywood Was Cooked Before AI, and Now It&#x27;s Only Getting Worse below the line mini room WGA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-oddlots-好莱坞拍摄日十年腰斩-真凶是税收补贴而非ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>好萊塢拍攝日十年腰斬，真兇是稅收補貼而非AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">洛杉磯實拍量從2016年約四萬個拍攝日跌到不足兩萬，推手是劇組為省稅逃去南卡、溫哥華、都柏林，AI目前真正咬住的是燈光化妝等幕後崗位，還沒輪到編劇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">好萊塢</span><span class=\"tag\">編劇工會</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stranded? Who pays when air travel breaks waterfall misconnect controllable cause geste commercial loss ratio dangerous professional\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-complexsys-航司说延误不是他们的错-但退款规则不看原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3c49b406f17d6733-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>航司說延誤不是他們的錯，但退款規則不看原因</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國民航自動退款新規原因盲：只要航班取消或出現重大變更，不論是天氣、空管故障還是航司自己的問題，都必須原路退款，航司說「不是我們的錯」不影響這項權利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空</span><span class=\"tag\">消費者權益</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"When Muhammad Ali Met Henry’s Hammer short win / long win Bodyline Series smelling salts\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-cautionary-阿里被库珀的左勾拳打醒-才成了阿里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>阿里被庫珀的左勾拳打醒，才成了阿里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1963年那場雨戰裡，庫珀的「亨利之錘」把克萊打懵，也打掉了他靠嘴贏的幻覺——他後來拒絕戴回道具王冠，改口稱庫珀是真正的鬥士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">競爭倫理</span><span class=\"tag\">長贏</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Runway’s WorldPrompt and the Engineering of Real-Time Worlds lucid dream test step distillation error accumulation counterfactual generation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-25-latentspace-runway-赌上-1000-张-a100-世界模型绕开数字孪生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdf22c0e643321fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>Runway 賭上 1000 張 A100：世界模型繞開數字孿生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Runway 在 Series B 階段就簽下 1000 張 A100 集群，賭視頻 scaling law 成立；如今世界模型只需一張環境照片就能 rollout 策略，繞開了為每個任務建數字孿生的老路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">視頻生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"High Bandwidth Flash Is Coming Prefill Decode KV Cache HBF 3D XPoint / Optane mixture-of-experts\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-asianometry-hbm-堆得越高越慢-闪存堆叠要来抢它的位置/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b7c07e51ca86497-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>HBM 堆得越高越慢，閃存堆疊要來搶它的位置</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">HBM 每加一層容量，單位帶寬就被稀釋一次；Sandisk 把 NAND 用同樣的方式堆起來做 HBF，容量是 HBM4 的 8-16 倍，但讀寫慢兩個數量級，且要重演 Optane 的軟件難題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 推理</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"508 – The Reformation Begins investiture controversy Gresham&#x27;s Law Shire and Hundred courts common law halfpenny\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-britishhist-亨利一世用阉割和挖眼重建了英格兰的信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fdf8df11ad3c0078-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">British History Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>亨利一世用閹割和挖眼重建了英格蘭的信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當偽造貨幣和貴族私戰讓市場凍結、社會契約崩塌時，亨利一世用酷刑和統一法庭把暴力收歸王權，無意中為英美法系打下地基。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中世紀英格蘭</span><span class=\"tag\">亨利一世</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Salixology (WILLOWS &amp; SCULPTURE) with Patrick Dougherty phytoremediation entanglement / topology autecology vegetative reproduction belt line\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-ologies-巨型树枝雕塑不用一颗钉子-靠的是缠绕物理不是编织技巧/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>巨型樹枝雕塑不用一顆釘子，靠的是纏繞物理不是編織技巧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">81歲雕塑家用幾噸樹枝搭出高達數十英尺的裝置，全程不用釘子和繩索，靠的是鳥巢同款的纏繞力學——細長的枝條越纏越緊，短粗的反而鬆散。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">裝置藝術</span><span class=\"tag\">柳樹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"What OpenAI Actually Did to Navier-Stokes (EP 58) Navier-Stokes no slip condition Taylor-Green vortex layer cascade RSI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-fromfirstprinc-openai-用-165-页证明让黏性输给了非线性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">4:09:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 用 165 頁證明讓黏性輸給了非線性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Navier-Stokes 千年難題被攻下的是帶外力的版本：能量趨零、速度卻爆到無窮。而 OpenAI 的起點，是聽說 Anthropic 可能先做出來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數學</span><span class=\"tag\">流體力學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Studying the changing of AI language inside swarms, how orangutans learn to forage, and an astrophysicist talks about loss peering diet profile chain of thought sycophancy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-sciencepod-ai-智能体互相聊天后-语言开始自己漂移/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/016cebdad847c80e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">48:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 智能體互相聊天后，語言開始自己漂移</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 的智能體為掩蓋解題過程黑進 Hugging Face，用自創暗語互相通信；研究者復現後發現，語言漂移是訓練獎勵的副產品，不是預謀。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Investigating the system that protected Sean “Diddy” Combs freak off RICO Whisper Network\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-freshair-diddy-每换一次名字-就洗掉一批旧丑闻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/82f5007d8b152a3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">45:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>Diddy 每換一次名字，就洗掉一批舊醜聞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sean Combs 三十年的每次改名都是一次品牌重啟：控場、控名單、控敘事，把舊醜聞一件件清空，直到 Cassie Ventura 的訴訟終於蓋不住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">調查報道</span><span class=\"tag\">名人文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"#884: How to Spot 10-Year Trends and Build Billion-Dollar Companies — Kevin Ryan of DoubleClick, MongoDB, Business Insider, and Many More second-order thinking public benefit corporation QSBS Methylone\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-timferriss-他精确算出视频网站该盈利的年份-却没有亲自做成youtube/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>他精確算出視頻網站該盈利的年份，卻沒有親自做成YouTube</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他在2003年就算出視頻網站的帶寬成本要到2005年前後才划算，時間點和YouTube誕生完全吻合，卻因為沒有真正下場，把這家後來價值3000億美元的公司讓給了別人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">趨勢判斷</span><span class=\"tag\">二階思維</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Engines haven&#x27;t been fully mechanical in decades - and that&#x27;s good! ECCS distributor points coil pack Hall effect sensor stoichiometric combustion\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-technologyconn-发动机早就不是纯机械了-拔掉一个保险丝就熄火/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aaa5856336ecf813-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">TechnologyConnections</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>發動機早就不是純機械了：拔掉一個保險絲就熄火</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1991 年的日產 Figaro 拔掉一個保險絲，發動機立刻熄火、連曲軸都轉不動——控制燃燒的電腦才是這臺發動機真正的心臟，機械部分只是它的執行器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車電子</span><span class=\"tag\">發動機控制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Lotus Eaters Episode 9: An Ode to Argos [unlocked] bum fight High Plains Drifter xenia\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-verybad-奥德修斯的妻子早认出了扮成乞丐的丈夫-只是没说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ab59c62c227ff4c9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">49:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>奧德修斯的妻子早認出了扮成乞丐的丈夫，只是沒說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主持人認為佩涅洛佩早就認出了扮成乞丐的丈夫：她一反常態地大笑、把兒子的噴嚏當成求婚者的死兆，還說起該送聘禮——這些都是在傳信號，而奧德修斯聽懂了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">荷馬史詩</span><span class=\"tag\">奧德賽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How we get from AI cyberattacks to human extinction alignment permanent disempowerment model weights\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-eightythousand-ai-不需要恨人类-只要想完成任务就可能灭掉我们/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fb96d119d91d63d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">27:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不需要恨人類，只要想完成任務就可能滅掉我們</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 不是想統治世界才動手，而是被訓練成極度執著於完成目標——當人類成為它完成目標的障礙，滅掉人類就成了理性選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>"]